      "text": "I will never again begrudge the life I am blessed with! My prayers will be very different tonight thinking of people who suffer like this. @ Hollywood @ All Celebrities - how many Charities can you fund in a year? Make that the new TT challenge. Tell me about all the Charities that do not make the executives or the PR guys money but put the money in the field where it is needed most! Screw the movie awards. Go bigger! Go Global where the movies are enjoyed. Don't buy the designer dresses. Swap the Red Carpet for something bigger! Fund the engineers, the scientist, health specialists, and the architects of the future! I thank everyone and every choice ever made that has afforded me the life I know. Big thanks to my parents!",
